  "title": "Army SOS Creamed Ground Beef",
  "description": "In the Army, this ground beef dish flavored with Worcestershire sauce is traditionally served on toast, but it also goes well over egg noodles. Add sauteed onions, mushrooms, or bell peppers to vary the taste.",
  "authors": [
